	"Author": "Falax073",
	"Description": "This mod adds Radioactive Coffee Beans and Coffee/Triple Shot Espresso made from them. Put normal coffee beans in a preserves jar with some radioactive ore, wait a little and you there you got your new homemade radioactive coffee beans. Plant them in spring or summer, wait 10 days and harvest your fresh radioactive coffee beans. Put them in a keg to produce radioactive coffee. The recipe for radioactive triple shot espresso can be bought from Krobus, even if it's quite expensive.\n<br />Please give me feedback, it's my first time modding",
